  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "櫜寘山巔，銷鋒鑄刃。示不復用，天下大歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1080cb5c25d5ec7790df8fc7e62b0e0520e03e25e2a90af33f4c6b6befc68fcf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6f4f880ac86ee22e28f0b6572fc94e08cd4f3af71f617c35d92fc9d7bea82373"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "一臂六手，不使堵口。莫肯為用，利棄我走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05987b74f9c555efe9a21090b06fa9092b052efcb8232d774a6e5fbaabfd6360",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a62483c47e453be6119a8002725e48334cd25169b99d087536cdc229d778aa3d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "獐鹿逐木，飽歸其居，安息無悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f3e534cec8e7f0bd4ac10b3e1989c0063a67511193097bef844915c1dd2eb4a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df142f4ea6e5fd96bf4cd8d580ca92f3fdc5dd1ba3ef6db65784754824254c6e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "鴻魚逆流，主人潛處。蓬蒿代柱，天屋顛倒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:62b4690de8b0a1c0b24962d6585752a1fda7f28930ca2e410579dff6f99e9637",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:710e389c59662454c54abdb478bf1972ae823ee0e310508d6959bfa1458df69f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "三羖五牂，相隨俱行。迷入空澤，經涉六駿。為賊所傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ba7da451ff1192b4bc42078b6288b900f79d90d41ef0ac1d2055b6a609ae8f4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d856cd32de4ff2f01a0ad8294a303697e5648f3f129eb45fcafc06b140580785"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "黃帝出遊，駕龍乘馬。乘上泰山，南過齊魯。邦國咸喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:75602f7732c461dba7c28bd71f98acc6a9f04d5172a098c5ab1572d7f3855e41",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9dbd478d09af1b731f2a3ae315bb8332d6fa83927f406904c89351dfaed736b7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "履危不安，心欲東西。步走逐鹿，空無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dac9063ac59ffad3e3088b10d05e257bfae67c6460c8b969356d5c23a5a8fa2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13a3f1a02f180543c90a970be33918eb0217a0efb61aa6d8bac057e82fed627b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "望尚阿衡，太宰周公。藩屏湯武，立為侯王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:83bc7e85fa4507e92b00999b4b08b0d0d69b6e2fe2027ab9a73563b226087196",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d6f2a131dfbc39b7e44114418e5363668bb2fdb84d06baa8046b48468849f3f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "白龍黑虎，起伏俱怒。戰於阪兆，蚩尤走敗。死於魯首。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a536d6be0ee3ae97657a0359d572b9098619a04a5143a68a45bb928caf3291f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:564227fe77370eb0dcd076b55533ac8a8f0fff8bb0bebaff86ebefe17f060f92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "載石上山，步跌不前。頻眉之憂，不得所歡。長思憂歎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0da48eb680321a06647e409c07f4b009954bcd7d0f0aa9e3948a1af7e30afae7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d110de5e048069654fd696f89a7929493ea3db923151e51ac6886bf05241b785"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "周德既成，行軸不傾。中酉跌墓，耋老衰去。箴石不祐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6222ba0de8ecbdaac358fa2fb8a98cfe6a6859cb28e885062b8def2166f5717",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e28940d2bc581967c0988747bd235809f366091979badc62b5a41e81c349ef45"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "乘雲帶雨，與飛鳥俱。舉動千里，見我慈母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a45565bfa75b79c728c70b093d1ba171dff1b13aaac40a5bdd28a1628068ec78",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:762119e25ca8c54447ea310965c68ea3165260be04b5577bb6a63484d038f483"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "齎貝贖狸，不聽我辭。繫於虎鬚，牽不得來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94404af1d0a28b9c78a7b9751084bb74670c9da8254248f8744b7d2fca8ad5ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5736044c886365c2eb3863a079c6a9b15ae50937e94ec18f59042eccb8aa90dc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "三翼飛來，字我逢時。俱行先至，多得大利。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a4bd3f7693f689bd14427d5c1f0cc456f879cd3a174be967adfd739d027f91c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:10839b1ca9d369143efa6c265da13332c9fe310f2812db0cd2d289d458be02a0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "兩足四翼，飛入我國。寧我伯姊，與母相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ed870b09aff949d29127afba6fe8d158bd3cd801db96fa719a5d65ecb29a8ca5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d056165996fd7cd918dcd4b10112b956b8deef85eec7c49fb42f25a34f4af2db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "案民湖池，玉盃天授。魚如白雲，一國獲鯉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d8d1694d85a28675a9830b4872a443a89fb28d9ec61cc817101b4c44c821950b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:15f57ba630d786e7ce69fc629e19552758d403ef925851ac355f7dc3d1832970"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "季姬踟躕，望還城隅。終日至暮，不見齊侯。居室無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:012c0db4b871c1d1eea875f774dba4ec423e18472a4b1a7f14c15aa1fa08a7dc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:15e17e08962db4e72fe264841fbe3b8a2c78cbf81763e9a4b98276d62e699c12"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "龍隅求泉，置雲影從。河伯捧觴，跪進酒漿。流潦滂滂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7a5020035b2b1f728fd8a0a9f794bed683d709d300e4030faba8633ca14bec2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:468124e76e4cf35bfba4674ba59fb5b2f645fd5fe2c4769794cdb9ef268c3630"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "出門逢患，與怒為怨。更相擊刺，傷我手端。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e90eca48105829d4ff391995bfdb883b904bf22d68a5464ad970175f1e2b628",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65424652c7afc072f58a0151a0b5aceff6ba89eebc5b4ab16bc7693fb6392e38"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "播衣樂天，乾坤所命，安樂無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e86ce99dea810c0ab97606350e68d64f732098aeb9fe1ac2d30390847443d339",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6647a9eb76fd3081fb331a9c573cd7fda51964df355dbcd46ca518346987ea60"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "兩金相擊，勇武敢敵。終日大戰，不破不缺。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c556168253353531e42bc1e4d7fd1a3bf815cb3d9f70f462185e2832e086d8a6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebaf1c73b410403f091a3ba821f92689c3ecedf804c2e8b398f11c5437d7b94a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "大車難駕，兩靷如繩。馬奔山後，輪脫不行。中道遇害。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:abd5056921f39b35d895a89126ce741d7508d2f0614f5b1ba2a13bd68e3ccd83",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f4ae7e71e3919e9e73d24999dadec2d3d039c0a4f4806a174203ceeca6ec5b37"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "文山紫芝，雍梁朱草。長生和氣，與以為寶。公尸侑食，神福來處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:656bbc14e16e79c70ddc8d32f80cd2bfbe291d59d38eb4afdab4b53d3735663f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b8fa213599bd444d85cd9657ae1b7b839acbe3d52575dde3141b4a2e164c489f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "把珠入口，為我畜寶。得吾所有，欣然嘉喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:addaa21fd5f7ed44b373308f924c3d440ad2c3086026fa7b1a706b07d8b78bcc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db7ee0210be30e446e4db453ecffe8fe12566b689903817330d5d0d439fe7da9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "負車上山，力盡行難。烈風雨雪，遮過我前。中道復還，憂者得歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ecfef8752bd2cad6ca918356d7556b7c96332561a09829b1e4603a5fd3058ca3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f0ea37ba5bf382a3295792ae142431bfea4e8cbd1d654ce6d1ebc294cd6cf836"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "陶朱白圭，善賈息資。三致千金，德施上仁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ab2a0d796f7714b103451f1c8ae02a249a53c180dca8a6ab0a0fb20cb5a8f93d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65e5927ccf670c09d890d1acda2a515c870d5d8504581b12f28526bc728049bc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "子鉏執麟，春秋作經。元聖將終，尼父悲心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eaa78f261aeabd348fe535a76ed770d0407148079ffcc1c85e3957361eb23831",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf65933fbe73ea50a7302a68428c6611a9120fae42f611a36d5a787aed75bffa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "春日載陽，福履齊長。四時不忒，與樂為昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00431c581937c85ffea0e5405c98437bfc914243e30e2b7e1faf27877901feae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:77da99f13965565b5ca270c43ceb58b012d5944a3755f550190aa4fce465539d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "孔懷如玉，出於幽谷。飛上喬木，鼓其羽翼。耀光照目。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:87c86cb8936e5a60928e22246c2f555d8fb0c28b0f29e3844067219cb78ece71",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad0d02f19ceacf3878efc14973fb4ee9937837edd0f8d3208d1562b70cdaab86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "區脫康居，慕仁入朝。湛露之歡，三爵畢恩。復歸穹廬，以安其居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:20b491c67c49b28940e5f091bb8803528cc9c5d6ee57f68273d7dd04e253d012",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e77c83f8def6159e59323ff38362add4c2bbf31d434c5468a649c9f823079181"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "秋冬夜行，照覽星辰。道理利通，終身無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:54bd2f108a9275286ae5c29f49001213b1fecbdd31c395c03dbf3b5f79edd37b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:812e3cdeb83406e81454b01561877e6bf361a0fc56793b5b3e1c93214f21f10d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "如鶴抱子，見蛇何咎。室家俱在，不失其所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2c03b1baf0289ace3e08c1d60d40a259c110951a63160b0bbd4b696ca95ad790",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5849dc860d849674c0c6560207897841318b885214fd0fbc246992e0c6965a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "安如泰山，福壽屢臻。雖有豺虎，不能危身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e91f0633fb5cc70856498e2ddab664f254b5d1542ce9a66aa3aaf0dbf21ec3f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3334d7e91942cfd11e63790705afe6108bc7f57232ab100a98e34ee797f27b99"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "耆蒙睡眠，不知東西。歲君失理，命直為曲。玉稱為寶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6aea2954df8cae886940c179feed46f3bc55fee04ba8d597f3e1af4866fcf2e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e645b40630412bd2485d6cd7d0f8b3edf2b43d1b40335c440723a7e727870f07"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "載璧秉珪，請命於河。周公克敏，沖人瘳瘉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47eb522586b34d08ca924cdf02bfc4ec70748dedb35e17b2ec4753c3f7652cb5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bdcad3e96e19fe64a1b154ca5e46f52594052a9a88655d2b794966cacda07466"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "天王執政，歲熟民富。國家豐有，王者有喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6be1cf4a2f3e4d7c171fe149c0f2aedd20304fc0b3d67fa157a0d938ff88ee99",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:70997c461b3d7812371f86730275b8c54bea310bb080109dc2cdedbef6aa6fe5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "訟爭相背，和氣不處。陰陽俱否，谷風母子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c2128dc561053f77c1ba6712b1ecc87bd239506e69d9c8b76b06dfb48ba73d10",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5282458c8c5b39bd63241c9419493c75d268d9a2b04553d10db52d9fb3b75bcb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "齊魯爭言，戰於龍門。搆怨結禍，三世不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fedb15618db6b7f2b71cf9e90508c0acfdf09cc69ee1164801015be8bbbeda15",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1be3a81c4a4d06ece7a09fe9d6eb85ea2f4276a9ac27a2cd1a15e5185f7f332a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "鹿得美草，鳴呼其友。九族和睦，不離邦域。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c71fdddbe845066ce67f64554c6d2929529cb12d7e1134f40a05e1bbeaac8be1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6a4430392d906e10c6eed0161520a3dc0e222d92aa55b2807e7e11296b6faba5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "百里難行，雖微復明。去虞適秦，為穆國卿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c9030465a649535dbf52122c20361fb522684785bdd9f0ae769a873330e1089",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d3a0f269a97cb8bbb3c240729b312b5c7431074032b3ca2e1176bcffe2e239d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "梅李冬實，國多寇賊。亂擾並作，王不能制。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:127cdffe95a228340c4dd448de486c1aec7af0548b6fb2605f829225a1fe94c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d922d8451758a93856c832afc3a19c92046ddd532cc6c2357d52ba25456997d0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "府藏之富，王以賑貸。捕魚河海，笱網多得。巨蛇大 ，戰於國郊，君遂走逃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e5a0f4494d34638e8db0ca607e1e65b1b25e2493f3419c1649c775238eb0613b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa293a7150b44f986ead618c36df5c6766b6840afa81df1310264a5bb5cb4ddc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "牡飛門啟，憂患大解，不為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f0c4598a5e9dc99688d3be767923d9462c93d76bedaae58f26dcefadef196a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2cd2311af404f615f367a39979298d903e6357bf38cc0a36a9b682459405295c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "宜昌娶婦，東家歌舞，長樂歡喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e91e715bed32ea073ef952f476cffa3e72d7ca1d5a85d9c9bda5e634873b5ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:53fd8c87b1e6a96bba8ea41d6758f29cc18e0ad86cf45521ee76731832bb95e0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "正陽之央，申氏以亡。禍及留吁，煙滅為墟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6ec06f2c32e2bfb01661176b13c1ae19cd4a75ab0a2a0807243fd7f0b54a0d93",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:31620294765b95e16bac508332901c676bd6607a87019c16bb48b31a5fd493d1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "鳧過稻廬，甘樂 。雖驅不走，田畯懷憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c828feab380e6b7f31b9d3b4a12a65304fe412592fc39a538dcf57cb9e35f1e6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a31fe210e758e7d35e0bc6ac1a8f32efe120122b318004e9b8479b61a752262"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "跛踦俱行，日暮車傷，失旅乏糧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2b78200354414dada546b3b3b367cb24bc72634aec6352d53001125e0b77ad38",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4d8be207864676d50659cd4125b0d1fd28051ad858d795decbc7877155d74d08"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "龍門小穴，流行不害。民安其土，君臣相保。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ca64004030c006a1f3d93777892ef3f29f8212dd6e301dd9cc3f6b3b38a40a38",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d0cf78ca4269d3e9632a76b1cccc218c596c74d711478e78c44adaa4ac6838a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "山陵西塞，遏我徑路。欲前不得，俱還故處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ae3a922dac6e30a319169daf74d3ea4db499185505eb537dfab0228cb2b588b3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:99a5d7131f2f1abc1f42dcbcfa92f4b76c981abb9e5415725fd106f79aadaeb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "兩虎爭鬥，血流浮杵。城郭空虛，蒿藜塞道。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9102f2d297658dddb7a1fef16c87ba036232ff362e26e75d07ebcea1d6a84cc1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d5a8294a5e66530b2b7868fe634decd7ddd4dd6fdd9d806dfd22cf6f7eec9c6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "依東牆隅，志下心勞。楚亭晨食，韓子低頭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3396d7b259ae411ca57508587681a7a380cd9449b357ab83bffeea8306050f89",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9cc5c07837a07743e9de1b4bab3e681b48306249a88737e68af027de12b39096"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "龍生無常，或托空桑。憑乘風雲，為堯立功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:decc0817959af2415cde5f96c666e0f4c91f734a6668b5ded31784193b5995db",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22817d056f252b635b46b9abaec2b614c7c4c038a689b2093bee20d9a7d40b3a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "魁行搖尾，逐雲吹火。汙泥為陸，下田為稷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e2538ccaed3034847c4deab92729bb86bdb06f7d139e5840517da14462dd45c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92f3c2fe1ab054483146158d78300dea4a74454b5fd4e4ace416fb277703839b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "跛踦相隨，日暮牛罷。陵遲後旅，失利亡雌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7129e30424576ced1d3f7c84a7d71d809cbcfae3e9690bdff6128b378249ad46",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:095b7fb7675a591a34da18a59e826c06bfd2ebeeda96b63a9251140d9dd18bda"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "三人俱行，北求大牂。長子病足，請季負囊。柳下之責，不失驪黃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6a1dfdb7bb1b4f8c0a761894fb9edf831756f902aad5a2225c84bf034677560",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f917b5664ea24bc14fb41fe8ac05688a80d8706c69bac6a47896233ff5eb0b01"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "鳳凰在左，麒麟在右。仁聖相遇，伊呂集聚。傷害不至，時無殃咎。福為我母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c27463656e113179e51d7fd49aba03ae988c1e3901f269b733ad961e39434fe8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8ab2055d1244d371190f4f2c8bb9399c4c2607fb4531ce66ff2c247f8af3727c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "乘筏渡河，雖深不殆。曾孫皇祖，累累俱在。受其大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad6f4a0efbb61357808471c2e5ca629ca68edc7db77c12680fe3245d8a7269de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ffad52e9d56f0f54f5b98146a2cff8901cd53d96a07362db4d9158c24f5af44b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "比目四翼，來安吾國。 福上堂，與我同床。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d829aa19ef3145549a9fb1db1814ff181a369de33bca226a78b3a398b87ac2e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4d71212e2372f901c31cc8b4650956b58b72cf0115817da2ae482fc16de121d2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "娶於姜女，駕迎新婦。少妻在門，夫子悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f71a83c94652120f28f23b2738002ff3fda9ff88477b3be340653d9ad3ed4e03",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a2cd6fbeeccd359cf7029f393bff0ce10f0c94bc93dff61a32682bff2e197fc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我稼穡。冬禾殫麥，秋無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:522c29dc8d03584e9cf59780e0349e7ebf036a0ded3e122ac7a9ffee60c8194c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8af9dc3906a1bd343ae8a88dbc98327824207ab433dcfe3f2f5f6d4cb68034f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "衣裳顛倒，為王來呼。成就東周，邦國大休。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:96b81f31e81156d4e77c0fbb89cd06a3650ea0521e266e14e16d69ab797fe56f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01e3e9c360af0abe0774aa821e6b3586e0abae4af3dc11eee8de906bfc377041"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "王孫季子，相與為友。明允篤誠，升擢薦舉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59e914f3767faeb4d70ef541f24769aad336789f9f00f099fadd13e6e37c5312",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b5177947bd2f4f4cc72b5f6659fc3fa1bd8d230ae2d1e05d5323e073c89adc8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "涌泉滑滑，流行不絕。汙為江海，敗毀邑里。家無所處，聞虎不悸。向我笑喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1d3eab99e52207ae8c7a8e1be7b2db16aff6aab83ed0564367e709c9dc7539af",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1ed907a640a14e0f35aa647e271ace43d62a7f6ee0840fc587c056b744b2916"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 13,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "桑扈竊脂，啄粟不宜。亂政無常，使我孔明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:20a99cdc866783d86ee3baf388a3f8910310744e7c7cf977d58682a8e9e520d5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1a7a0d55a44bbf6b2dfb1f5284ff839f082b67f69c124a816e1a60d26fdc5572"
    }
  ]
}
